from parts/safari-enter.replay
# sys-safari-daily (docs/research/great-marsh.md): the Great Marsh's daily species follow SpecialEncounter marshDaily:
# a new game's own value until the first day change, then the day's RecordMixedRNG value
# (SpecialEncounter_SetMixedRecordDailies in FieldSystem_HandleDailyEvents). The clock rolls over to the next day in the
# marsh; the test reads the daily species of each area before and after.
+0 date 2009-03-23 12:00
+0 press up
until position 68 115
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_SAFARI_GAME_ACTIVE true
